<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Skyblock Garden carrot farming</Major>
    <Description>Not fully efficient but if you adjuct 90 degrees to the crops it will autofarm 1 plot using rows of 5 crops. Can be used to farm carrots, potatoes, or other crops that work in this layout. You will need to reset to the start each time, and crops won't be grown by the time you get back to the start, but it works.</Description>
